        "created_at": "2020-03-31T17:27:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<ol>\n\t<li>Nope, Dahan being destroyed through damage are still being destroyed, so Share Secrets of Survival protects them.</li>\n\t<li>Yes, you have this correct.&nbsp; Just be careful while you're flipping things to never reveal the front of the card you never turned face up, until it's time to resolve it.</li>\n</ol>",
